  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened capacity of member States to ratify and apply international labour standards and to fulfil their reporting obligations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Cook Islands Government and constituents have provided regular reports to the ILO fulfilling requirements on their reporting obligations and the ILO continues to provide technical support, guidance and resources to ensure this continues. This includes forms and instructions for submitting reports on both ratified and non-ratified conventions under Article 22 of the ILO Constitution.</narrative>
  </description>
